      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……烈焰快驹的眼神，实在太过笔直。\n那份心意，那些话语，完全不容置疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6117f91b68be4bc7c645a88421965f268b71ffd064676cab93f3588a3a2ed78f",
