      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对速子酱她们，我也是打算认真去战胜的！\n所以无论如何，请您考虑一下……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f50dccc5e2ca80c5ce22d8ce33f7b28df1b5d53c184a7d9be7d7196e6f0448",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
