      "uid": "zhcn:73717d6dec459f2d6fd91d71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "欣喜的烈焰快驹的模样，是我所熟悉的。然而，\n此刻她内心深藏的东西……恐怕我，一无所知。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e7d66672a3d81b3caf6863f9667fe4e736f36a7a39ee5c2975b52b485d31ad2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
